        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: चक्रीवादळ",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "चक्रीवादळ — cakrīvādaḷ — \"a cyclone\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "चक्रीवादळामुळे गावात खूप पडझड झाली. cakrīvādaḷāmuḷe gāvāt khūp paḍjhaḍ jhālī. The cyclone brought down a lot in the village."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Neuter."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "चक्री, whirling, and वादळ, a storm."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "चक्रीवादळ (cakrīvādaḷ) is built from cakrī, \"whirling\", on Sanskrit cakra, \"a wheel\" (CDIAL 4538), and वादळ, \"a storm\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for getting around."
